---
import company from '../../data_files/company.json';
---

<section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1: Adresten Hurda Alımı -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/60 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-slate-700 group-hover:bg-amber-50 group-hover:text-amber-600 group-hover:border-amber-200 transition-colors">
            <!-- Truck Icon -->
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM19 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16V6a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v10a1 1 0 001 1h1m8-1a1 1 0 01-1 1H9m4-1V8a1 1 0 011-1h2.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l3.414 3.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V16a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1m-6-1a1 1 0 001 1h1M5 17a2 2 0 104 0m-4 0a2 2 0 114 0m6 0a2 2 0 104 0m-4 0a2 2 0 114 0" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5 flex-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Adresten Hurda Alımı</h2>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-100/70 text-amber-900 border border-amber-200/70">
                1 Saatte Kapıda
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Kendi araç filomuz ve deneyimli taşıma personelimizle kapınıza geliyoruz. Hamaliye veya nakliye masrafı ödemeden hurdalarınızı teslim alıyoruz.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2: Hassas Dijital Tartım -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/60 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-slate-700 group-hover:bg-amber-50 group-hover:text-amber-600 group-hover:border-amber-200 transition-colors">
            <!-- Scale Icon -->
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5 flex-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Hassas Dijital Tartım</h2>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-100/70 text-blue-900 border border-blue-200/70">
                Gramı Gramına
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Gözünüzün önünde, elektronik kalibre dijital baskülle şeffaf tartım yapıyoruz. Gram fire veya eksik tartım kuşkusu olmadan net tartım fişi veriyoruz.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3: Anında Peşin Nakit -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/60 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-slate-700 group-hover:bg-emerald-50 group-hover:text-emerald-600 group-hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors">
            <!-- Banknote/Cash Icon -->
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5 flex-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Anında Peşin Nakit</h2>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-100/70 text-emerald-900 border border-emerald-200/70">
                Kapıda Elden
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Tartım bittiği saniye elden peşin nakit veya banka hesabınıza anında FAST/havale transferi yapıyoruz. Hurdanızı teslim edip günlerce ödeme beklemezsiniz.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
